OL,5,G1830 Home and Away
OL,6,     FSummer Bay is rocked by a shocking
OL,7,     Fact of vandalism. Mackenzie and
OL,8,     FLevi face a tough decision.
OL,9,     FMarilyn makes an impassioned plea.
OL,10,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,11,     FThe doctors run two specialist
OL,12,     Fclinics alongside their usual
OL,13,     Fpractice work. After finding a
OL,14,     Flump in her breast, Linda is
OL,15,     Fquickly referred.
OL,16,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,17,     FNew to the department, Doctor
OL,18,     FMartha Ellis-Parkinson is thrown
OL,19,     Fin at the deep end, as paramedics
OL,20,     Fbring in a 78-year-old former
OL,21,     Fminer who is suffering with chest
OL,22,     Fpain.
