OL,5,G2100 999: Critical Condition
OL,6,     FSeventeen-year-old Dougie is
OL,7,     Frushed in by helicopter after a
OL,8,     Fmountain bike accident leaves him
OL,9,     Fwith a catastrophic head injury. A
OL,10,     Fscan shows his brain is bleeding.
OL,11,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,12,     FWe follow the brave A&E
OL,13,     Fnight-shift teams in Belfast,
OL,14,     FNewham and Norwich. At Norfolk and
OL,15,     FNorwich Hospital, a stabbing sends
OL,16,     Fboth victim and attacker to A&E.
OL,17,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,18,     FFour top dermatologists treat
OL,19,     Fpatients for skin conditions such
OL,20,     Fas cysts, lipomas and skin tags
OL,21,     Fthat the NHS views as cosmetic but
OL,22,     Fthat can affect sufferers.
