OL,11,     Fsurgery went wrong.
OL,12,G0100 Killer on the Run
OL,13,     FAfter 17-year-old Shari Smith is
OL,14,     Fabducted, killer Larry Gene Bell
OL,15,     Fcalls the family to taunt them. As
OL,16,     Fanother girl is taken nearby,
OL,17,     Fdetectives race to catch him.
